    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313570/extras/5b425a34d112088e2770c8c66cffd56c.poster.avif?t=1748245571\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313570/extras/5b425a34d112088e2770c8c66cffd56c.webm?t=1748245571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313570/extras/5b425a34d112088e2770c8c66cffd56c.mp4?t=1748245571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313570/extras/df6e0a47d6fe4ec0a906c399cb4fdfcf.avif?t=1748245571\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rhya's Crusade: The Aradia's Reavers, is an action-packed game with the soul of a Run &amp; Gun classic featuring NES/Famicom palette and resolution with modern physics simulation and dynamic lightning making a frenetic mix made for players who love retro classics with a naughty side. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is for adult audiences who enjoy Hentai and challenging gameplay, throughout the levels, Rhya's clothes tear apart as she takes damage, being exposed to lewd enemy glares. Stopping the plans of the sex-crazed Reavers could be a dangerous task. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313570/extras/2a0f6cb949a57c92b5321b7d0164f278.poster.avif?t=1748245571\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313570/extras/2a0f6cb949a57c92b5321b7d0164f278.webm?t=1748245571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313570/extras/2a0f6cb949a57c92b5321b7d0164f278.mp4?t=1748245571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as Rhya, a military-trained archaeologist who seeks to stop the Demon Princess\u00a0Aradia's ambition to control the galaxy . Equipped with the most advanced technology and the most powerful weapons, you will face the ruthless army of the little demon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the hidden beacons and destroy it to obtain hidden tapes containing Hentai CG's featuring various characters and story in the Rhya's Crusade universe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313570/extras/b26bffbe6e64d3cf2612f8b3aeba680a.avif?t=1748245571\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 levels, 7 bosses with a animated H-Scene each.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>28+ collectible static H-Scenes hidden in the levels. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 Different Weapon Modules to ease Rhya's mission. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chiptune music and sounds to match the retro feeling of the game. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A piece of lore in every scenes and dialogue if you want to know more about Rhya's universe. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMING SOON: Score and Time challenges to unlock more collectibles, scenes, etc.</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313570/extras/f771c3b2c5d229fceb04e768c79392f9.poster.avif?t=1748245571\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313570/extras/f771c3b2c5d229fceb04e768c79392f9.webm?t=1748245571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313570/extras/f771c3b2c5d229fceb04e768c79392f9.mp4?t=1748245571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313570/extras/5b425a34d112088e2770c8c66cffd56c.poster.avif?t=1748245571\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313570/extras/5b425a34d112088e2770c8c66cffd56c.webm?t=1748245571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313570/extras/5b425a34d112088e2770c8c66cffd56c.mp4?t=1748245571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313570/extras/df6e0a47d6fe4ec0a906c399cb4fdfcf.avif?t=1748245571\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rhya's Crusade: The Aradia's Reavers, is an action-packed game with the soul of a Run &amp; Gun classic featuring NES/Famicom palette and resolution with modern physics simulation and dynamic lightning making a frenetic mix made for players who love retro classics with a naughty side. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is for adult audiences who enjoy Hentai and challenging gameplay, throughout the levels, Rhya's clothes tear apart as she takes damage, being exposed to lewd enemy glares. Stopping the plans of the sex-crazed Reavers could be a dangerous task. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313570/extras/2a0f6cb949a57c92b5321b7d0164f278.poster.avif?t=1748245571\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313570/extras/2a0f6cb949a57c92b5321b7d0164f278.webm?t=1748245571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313570/extras/2a0f6cb949a57c92b5321b7d0164f278.mp4?t=1748245571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as Rhya, a military-trained archaeologist who seeks to stop the Demon Princess\u00a0Aradia's ambition to control the galaxy . Equipped with the most advanced technology and the most powerful weapons, you will face the ruthless army of the little demon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the hidden beacons and destroy it to obtain hidden tapes containing Hentai CG's featuring various characters and story in the Rhya's Crusade universe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313570/extras/b26bffbe6e64d3cf2612f8b3aeba680a.avif?t=1748245571\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 levels, 7 bosses with a animated H-Scene each.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>28+ collectible static H-Scenes hidden in the levels. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 Different Weapon Modules to ease Rhya's mission. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chiptune music and sounds to match the retro feeling of the game. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A piece of lore in every scenes and dialogue if you want to know more about Rhya's universe. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMING SOON: Score and Time challenges to unlock more collectibles, scenes, etc.</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313570/extras/f771c3b2c5d229fceb04e768c79392f9.poster.avif?t=1748245571\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313570/extras/f771c3b2c5d229fceb04e768c79392f9.webm?t=1748245571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313570/extras/f771c3b2c5d229fceb04e768c79392f9.mp4?t=1748245571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
